# Atabul Driving Center — environment template. Copy to .env.local (never committed).
#
# The ONLY value you must change before launch. Everything the SEO layer emits
# (canonical, og:url, og:image, twitter:image, sitemap.xml <loc>, robots.txt
# Sitemap:) is derived from it — see src/seo/site.ts#resolveOrigin.
#
# http://localhost:5173 is the agreed stand-in production origin while the site
# is unreleased. The build audit prints a warning while this stays a localhost.
VITE_SITE_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Real values for the cut-over (set in the hosting dashboard, not here):
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.in

# Optional: ISO date written into <lastmod> in sitemap.xml. Wire this to the
# COMMIT date in CI, never the build date — a lastmod that moves on every
# deploy teaches Google to ignore the field:
#   VITE_BUILD_DATE=$(git log -1 --format=%cd --date=short)
